From bf638a1161cd129cce951e74304f60d5c33b50ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: keno2003 <209372532+keno2003@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 20:44:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] egis0570: add a full-frame touch capture and matching
 path

Capture stationary touches on 1c7a:0570 and compare local image features with geometric verification. Preserve the legacy 0571 path. Add bounded template storage tests.

Tested on Acer Swift 1 (Swift SF114-32). Wider matcher validation and hardware replay coverage remain needed before upstream acceptance.
